      "message": "[warning] Line 708: 🟡 `wait_for()` restarts the full 10 second timeout after every wakeup, including spurious wakeups or unrelated input destruction notifications. This can block much longer than intended. Use `wait_until()` with a fixed deadline or the predicate overload to enforce a total timeout for this `getVideoInput()` call.",
