      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 732: 🔴 `videoInputsCv.notify_all()` is called while still holding `videoMutex`. A woken waiter immediately needs the same mutex, so it can only proceed after the deleter exits; more importantly, if any waiter times out exactly while the deleter holds the lock, it may still create a new `VideoInput` after the old one has already been destroyed. Move `notify_all()` after releasing the lock, e.g. use a scoped block for the erase, then notify.",
